# Track E1 KNOWN GAP — Box[Person].greet(5): user equip method through Box.
#
# INTENDED (per docs/language-design.md §9.4, "Deref Coercion"): the receiver
# auto-derefs through `DerefTarget` to the inner `Person`, resolves `greet` on
# `Person`, prints `35`.
#
# E1 status (this Track): closes the fabrication class as a REJECT for
# `DerefTarget`. Pre-fix the C backend fabricated `Box__Person__greet` (link
# error); post-fix the typechecker emits `E_NoMethodFound` at the terminal
# `MethodCall` fallthrough.
#
# E2 (deferred, pending owner ratification of §9.4 "Deref Coercion" +
# `docs/internals/cow-transient-view-model.md` §3.7 interaction): PROMOTES to
# auto-deref-through-inner + un-ignores this fixture.
struct Person:
    String name
    int age

equip Person:
    int greet(int e): return self.age + e

void main():
    Box[Person] b = Box[Person](Person("A", 30))
    print(b.greet(5))
